   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU  staffs recruited and established, advisory committee meeting per annum</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PMU was established specifically for this project hence baseline is zero</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">PETRA PMU performed the project implementation amidst limitations due to COVID-19 pandemic.
Project implementation progress consulted with PETRA Project Board at least once in 2022</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">As of 2022, 7 Districts in Central Sulawesi and NTB provinces are being supported for its recovery interventions 
9 Provinces supported for COVID-19 recovery needs assessment, Contingency planning and recovery planning.
1 District in Bali Province is being supported to enhance its tsunami preparedness inputs through a Regional Project, Tsunami Preparedness Phase III, ongoing until Dec 2022.

54 public service and community infrastructures were designed in line with the build forward better and safer approach, with improved accessibility for women and people with disability. Women were also involved in the construction work. This achievement is expected could improve the minimum standard for public and community services in post-disaster areas to withstand future disasters. 
in 2022, 33 out of 54 total targeted facilities had been reconstructed and handed over to GoI for further maintenance and utilization which contribute to the recovery of education services to students in 7 schools, health services in 12 healthcare facilities, and helps community restore their livelihood through the reconstruction of 13 community infrastructures.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">PETRA PMU performed the project implementation amidst limitations due to COVID-19 pandemic.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU functioning with new approaches in managing implementation rate and monitoring progress delivered by project partners, mainly through online communication.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
